  "notes": "Fluent-UI-like neutral app. Distinctive: datasources grouped by recency headers with explicit date ranges (e.g. 'Last month (11/6/2026 - 10/25/2026)'), each card with a line file-type icon (table for csv, doc for demos, braces for json). Single strong accent is the near-black 'Create DataSource' button; RATH logo uses a red/orange bird with orange 'A' letter. Sidebar is a light grey #fafafa column with a collapsible 'Exploratory Data Analysis' group and an 'Insiders(α)' expander; bottom utility cluster. Search filters live and regroups the results."
